WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.439
Before the world, there was God.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.091
To make room for creation, God gave himself away.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.400
One became everything.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.676
Stars. Worlds. Life.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.395
Did the giver survive the gift?

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.037
We keep the question open.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.144
We carry the gift forward.
